<title>USA: HUSSEY COPPER PRICE DROPS TO 121 CENTS/LB AUG 11.</title>
<headline>HUSSEY COPPER PRICE DROPS TO 121 CENTS/LB AUG 11.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hussey Copper Ltd said its contained copper price was down one cent to 121.00 cents per lb. effective with shipments of Aug 11. ((New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640))</p>
</text>
